# Flutter Monorepo — UI & Design System

Full rules: `DESIGN.md`. Compact reference below.

## Theme — always use Theme.of(context)

```dart
// ✅ colors
Theme.of(context).colorScheme.primary
Theme.of(context).colorScheme.error

// ✅ typography
Theme.of(context).textTheme.bodyLarge
Theme.of(context).textTheme.titleLarge

// ❌ never
Colors.blue  |  Color(0xFF...)  |  TextStyle(fontSize: 16)
```

## Spacing — AppSpacing tokens (xs=4, sm=8, md=16, lg=24, xl=32)

```dart
// ✅
SizedBox(height: AppSpacing.md)
Padding(padding: EdgeInsets.all(AppSpacing.sm))

// ❌
SizedBox(height: 16)
```

## Radii — AppRadius tokens (sm=4, md=8, lg=12, xl=16, full=999)

```dart
// ✅
BorderRadius.circular(AppRadius.lg)
AppRadius.mdAll  // pre-built BorderRadius

// ❌
BorderRadius.circular(12)
```

## Shared components

Use `AppButton`, `AppCard`, `AppTextField` from `design_system`.
If they don't fit — extend them in the package, not in the app.

## Responsive

- `MediaQuery.sizeOf(context)` for screen-level breakpoints
- `LayoutBuilder` for widget-level adaptation
- Breakpoints: < 600 mobile / 600–839 tablet / 840+ desktop

## Theming the app

```dart
// ✅
MaterialApp.router(
  theme: AppTheme.light(),
  darkTheme: AppTheme.dark(),
  themeMode: ThemeMode.system,
)
```
